        <p class="text-base text-muted-foreground mb-8 max-w-3xl">

          Most "cashmere factories" you find on Alibaba are trading companies with no production capacity. Even legitimate factories vary widely in quality systems. Here are 8 verifiable checks you can run from your desk before paying a deposit. We've included what we measure up to on each — so you have a benchmark.

