            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-2">Request PDF copies of certificates — not photos. Verify the certificate number on the issuing body's website (e.g. <a href="https://www.oeko-tex.com/" class="text-primary hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OEKO-TEX</a>, <a href="https://www.bsci-intl.org/" class="text-primary hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BSCI</a>). Expired certificates are worthless — check the validity dates.</p>

